  "cited_article_id": "configure-roles-and-permissions",
  "reply": "To audit and adjust permissions, go to **Settings > Practice Staff > Roles & Permissions**. Select the role used by your billing staff (or create a new role with **Create New Role**). Use the toggles to enable only the necessary **Billing** permissions and disable any financial ledger access. After adjusting, click **Assign Users**, ensure the correct staff are linked to the role, and press **Save Changes**. Verify each user’s account is active; if a menu still doesn’t appear, have the user clear their browser cache and log in again."
}
